OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor vows to lay naked in
OL,4,Amud over pipeline
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has offered to "lay in the
OL,7,Fmud naked" in order to prevent a carbon
OL,8,Fcapture pipeline being built.
OL,10,FWirral Councillors unanimously voted on
OL,11,FWednesday against granting developers
OL,12,Faccess to council land for a major gas
OL,13,Fpipe project, Peak Cluster, that could
OL,14,Fcut through the full length of the
OL,15,Fborough.
OL,17,FCouncillors were told before the debate
OL,18,Fif they had already made their decision
OL,19,Fand did not have an open mind they
OL,20,Fshould not take part in the vote.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
