OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor vows to lay naked in
OL,4,Amud over pipeline
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK's Kathy Hodson told the
OL,7,Fmeeting she therefore would not vote
OL,8,Fbecause she "would be voting against it
OL,9,Fno matter what", adding that she was
OL,10,Fwilling to "lay in the mud naked" to
OL,11,Fprevent the land being dug up.
